---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBar from '../components/CtaBar.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Window replacement"
  description="Replacement windows for Washington homes: full-frame and insert installs, energy-efficient glass, and a clear process from measure to finish."
  path="/replacement"
>
  <section class="wrap section">
    <p class="kicker">Services</p>
    <h1>Window replacement</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Most of the work we do is taking tired, leaky, or single-pane units out and putting the right
      replacement in the same opening — without wrecking the siding or the interior finish.
    </p>
    <div class="split">
      <article>
        <h2>Full-frame replacement</h2>
        <p>
          The old window and frame come out to the rough opening. This is the right call when the
          frame is rotten, out of square, or you want to change the look of the exterior trim.
        </p>
        <h2>Insert / pocket replacement</h2>
        <p>
          A new sash and frame set into a sound existing frame. Faster, less disruption, and often
          less cost when the opening is still structurally good.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>What we typically install</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Vinyl replacement windows</li>
          <li>Fiberglass when the opening and budget want it</li>
          <li>Double- and triple-pane insulated glass</li>
          <li>Low-E coatings matched to your climate zone</li>
          <li>Picture, slider, single-hung, and casement styles</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="fine-print">Brand list goes here once Mark confirms manufacturers.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBar />
</BaseLayout>
